(text "42 x 20 mm / 2 copper layers / top-side assembly / black solder mask\nUSB-C 5V only, direct VBUS to LED VCC. FH4R2: 4MB in-package flash + 2MB PSRAM.\nNo power-path diodes, source switching or firmware-controlled enables. Validate first assembled units." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "dc9dd3a1-80e9-5985-8ab7-db41966b75d8"))
